8680;&nbsp;&nbsp;Final Prerequisite Check</td></tr>\n      <tr><td style=\"padding:10px;background-color:#ffffff;\">\n        <p style=\"color:#0D0D0D;margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;\">With one week to go, you <b><u>must</u></b> already have working Sandbox access. If you do not, act <b>today</b>:</p>\n        <ol style=\"margin:0;padding-left:18px;font-size:14px;color:#0D0D0D;line-height:1.5;\">\n          <li>Confirm you completed the TMS <strong>\"EHRM Sandbox Login and Orientation Video\"</strong> course (NFED #4686318).</li>\n          <li>Confirm you received the provisioning email from <strong>VA-Account-Provisioning_US@oracle.com</strong>.</li>\n          <li><strong>Log in</strong> to your assigned Sandbox web portal to verify access now &mdash; do not wait for class day.</li>\n          <li>If you still cannot log in, contact the <a style=\"color:#000080;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"mailto:VAEHRMSandbox@va.gov\">VA EHRM Sandbox</a> national team <b>immediately</b>.</li>\n        </ol>\n      </td></tr>\n    </table>\n  </td></tr>"},"cmp_Footer":{"runAfter":{"cond_ShouldWait":["Succeeded","TimedOut","Skipped","Failed"],"cond_ShouldWait_1":["Succeeded","TimedOut","Failed","Skipped"]},"type":"Compose","inputs":"<tr><td style=\"padding:20px 15px 0 15px;\">\n    <table style=\"width:100%;border:4px solid #6c757d;border-collapse:collapse;background-color:#fff9e6;\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n      <tr><td style=\"background-color:#6c757d;color:#ffffff;padding:10px 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;\">&#10067;&nbsp;&nbsp;Questions or Need Assistance?</td></tr>\n      <tr><td style=\"padding:15px;background-color:#ffffff;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333333;\">Contact the Edward Hines Jr. VA Hospital's EHRM Team:</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333333;\">&#128222;&nbsp;&nbsp;Clinical Informatics help line: <a style=\"color:#000080;text-decoration:und